      "rulesText": "Drag chips from your 200 onto the bet circle (10 to 100), then click the shoe to deal. You and the dealer each get two cards; one of the dealer's stays face down.\n\n- **Hit**: click the shoe. **Stand**: click your hand. **Double**: double your bet for exactly one more card.\n- Cards count their number, faces count 10, an ace counts 1 or 11, whichever helps.\n- Over 21 is a bust. Then the dealer turns the hole card and hits until 17 or more.\n- Closer to 21 wins even money. A two-card 21 (blackjack) pays 3:2. A tie is a push.\n\nThe shoe holds **two of every card**, and the table remembers each copy separately: hover a face-up card to see where *that* 7♥ has been.",
